  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Chelsea, Sacred Sun Ink Tattoo Studio is a haven for those seeking masterful black & gray, intricate dotwork, and lush floral tattoos. Each client receives a fully personalized experience, ensuring that every custom design is as unique as their skin canvas. Connect with the artists at (617)-371-7757 to embark on a transformative ink journey that promises precision and artistry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Chelsea, Massachusetts, United States"
